# --- Model weights: NEVER commit these ---------------------------------
# Checkpoints are downloaded into the Docker image at build time by
# docker/fetch_models.py. The RTMO *config* under models/rtmo/ IS tracked
# (it is plain Python); only the binary weights are ignored.
*.pth
*.pt
*.onnx
*.engine
*.trt
*.safetensors
